> Count the executed architecture and preserve the common budget

Each conditioner has 16 hidden weights,16 hidden biases,32 head weights and two
head biases: 66 values. Four give 264; global log_scale adds two. Initialize
hidden kernels with normal deviation .3 and bias .05, head kernels .01 and
bias zero; warm the forward graph in block order, then initialize scale zero.
The same native seed 9403 is used independently for all three stores. The
optional original TensorFlow initial-array directory is absent, so the original
auto default selects native initialization. This is source replay, not a claim
of bit-identical TensorFlow random initialization.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/study_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(9403);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto o=n::models::RealNvpDensity(p,x);
 n::model_stage("Affine blocks 0 / 1",x,o.coupling1);n::model_stage("Affine blocks 2 / 3",o.coupling1,o.unscaled);
 return n::model_stage("Positive diagonal scale",o.unscaled,o.latent);},"Each family:266 values /17 leaves");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,2}),options);if(figure.parameter_count()!=266||p.size()!=17)throw std::runtime_error("Executed census");figure.save_svg("build/study_network.svg");
}
