> Inspect all original pools and their common fit budget

Every point is retained. The common [-5,7] axes use equal physical scales and
include all original observations and generated points, including samples
outside the original [-4,4] plotting window. Labels are procedural family and
split names, not real subjects or recordings.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/study_data.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
