> Keep every generated point and latent point visible

Each observation panel overlays all 1,024 inverse samples with 128 original
held-out points. Each latent panel uses all 1,024 common Gaussian draws and 128
transformed held-out points. Identical prior rows make differences in generated
samples consequences of the separate learned maps. These views do not pair
independent test observations with particular prior draws.

