> Read the controlled experiment at its actual scope

All 66 source archives,433,485 values, all 432 phase archives,76,752 phase values,
all histories, protocols, quality JSON and summary rows reproduce exactly.
The independent NumPy audit reconstructs every 3D Box-Muller observation and
source ID, derives both map Jacobians and coupling pullbacks, verifies all 144
Adam writes, checks all 798 model-parameter coordinates by finite differences,
and audits all 3,072 inverse samples. It reconstructs all analytic grid densities,
including 14,336 legitimate off-support checker zeros. It neither calls native
model math nor refits replacement data.

The comparison holds architecture, initialization, batch order and budget
constant while changing the analytic law. It shows useful banana bending,
weak eight-mode concentration and substantial checkerboard leakage. None of
these outcomes is repaired by silently extending the schedule, changing model
size, filtering samples or replacing the original data. A larger or differently
selected experiment would need separate evidence.

